Package: stat133data
Title: Course Datasets for STAT 133 PrairieLearn Workspaces
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: person("STAT 133", "Staff", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "stat133@berkeley.edu")
Description: Bundles small course datasets (e.g. 'ev', state-level EV registration
    counts) so they can be loaded in PrairieLearn RStudio workspaces with a plain
    data(ev) call, without requiring students to read a CSV or have internet
    access during a quiz.
License: MIT
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
